# BAWAAL Stability Checkpoint (LOCKED)

Production-final resilience contract for registration, social feed soft-fail, and remote media. Do **not** reintroduce hot-path `console.log`, unbounded retries, or hard throws on missing Supabase tables.

## 1. Profiles & registration

| Rule | Contract |
|---|---|
| Auth UUID | Real `auth.users` UUID → sanitized upsert to `public.profiles` |
| Local / non-UUID | `phone:…` / `local:…` → **zero** PostgREST calls; return local `ok: true` |
| Circuit breaker | First hard 400 / local-dev → session short-circuit; no further profiles queries |
| Payload | `PROFILE_SAFE_WRITE_COLUMNS` only; map form aliases (`real_name`↔`full_name`, `category`↔`primary_sport`, `location`↔`city_country`, `avatar_uri`↔`avatar_url`); denylist `list_bucket` + client junk |
| Schema miss | Soft-strip missing columns (bounded); fall back to `PROFILE_BASE_WRITE_COLUMNS`, then local success |
| SQL | `supabase/ENSURE_PROFILES_SPORTS_HUBS.sql` + `migrations/008_ensure_profiles_registration_columns.sql` |

Locked files: `src/services/profilesService.js`, `src/types/profile.js`, registration OTP wiring in `authOtp.js` / `RoleSelection.js` (UI lock still applies).

## 2. Social feed & table fallbacks

| Surface | Soft-fail |
|---|---|
| `likes` / `comments` | Prefer new tables; legacy `reel_likes` / `reel_banter` via try/catch |
| Missing table / 404 | Return `[]` or local mock; session short-circuit that table |
| `arena_challenges` / `videos` / battles | Never throw into Arena UX; empty array / local cache |
| Logging | `softFailWarn` once per key — **no** hot-path `console.log` |

Locked files: `src/services/videoSocialService.js`, `src/services/reelSocialService.js`, `src/utils/softFailLog.js`, soft-fail paths in `arenaChallengeService.js` / `arenaPostsService.js` / `arenaFeedStore.js`.

## 3. Arena media & vault

| Rule | Contract |
|---|---|
| Avatars / remote images | `SafeAvatar` / `SafeRemoteImage` + `normalizeRemoteImageUri` |
| onError | Swap to local `require(...)` (or black underlay for Arena posters — never logo blink) |
| Failed URI cache | Session set — do not re-fetch known 404 Storage URLs |
| Vault | Proprietary skeleton/skull PNGs only (`BawaalEmoji`); Image has silent `onError` |

## 4. Hygiene (camera pipeline ready)

- No unbounded retry loops on profiles / reel social / feed hydrate
- Persist retry: **at most one** automatic retry in `arenaFeedStore` (already capped)
- Prefer `softFailWarn` / silent catch over `console.error` / `console.log` on soft-fail paths

